00:23:31.017 --> 00:23:32.609
Put the gun down!


00:23:33.352 --> 00:23:36.287
This is the police!
Drop the gun now!


00:23:36.355 --> 00:23:37.879
<i>Don't listen to them.</i>


00:23:41.527 --> 00:23:45.327
No. Stop. Please.


00:23:45.398 --> 00:23:46.490
Put the gun down!


00:23:46.566 --> 00:23:48.659
Go ahead. You can do it!


00:23:48.734 --> 00:23:50.929
Put it down!
Put the gun down!


00:23:51.737 --> 00:23:53.136
Put the gun down now!


00:23:53.205 --> 00:23:55.799
Put that gun down,
God damn it!


00:23:55.875 --> 00:23:57.206
<i>I can't...</i>


00:24:02.148 --> 00:24:03.445
Please.


00:24:03.516 --> 00:24:05.416
<i>Please, don't tease him.
Please.</i>


00:24:05.551 --> 00:24:07.485
Please,
just stop hurting him.


00:24:07.553 --> 00:24:09.145
Please!


00:24:11.023 --> 00:24:13.890
This is the police!
Put the gun down now!


00:24:17.229 --> 00:24:18.355
No.


00:24:18.431 --> 00:24:20.126
You useless waste!


00:24:20.199 --> 00:24:21.860
No! No!


00:24:25.404 --> 00:24:26.928
No!


00:24:30.476 --> 00:24:31.465
No!


00:24:31.978 --> 00:24:34.071
Get your hands off of me!


00:24:36.148 --> 00:24:37.979
<i>Get up here!
Get up here!</i>


00:24:38.050 --> 00:24:40.280
<i>Let's go, man. This way!</i>


00:24:48.794 --> 00:24:51.092
<i>I want to die.</i>


00:24:56.936 --> 00:24:59.404
<i>No!
Grace?</i>


00:25:09.582 --> 00:25:11.982
Grace, do you know
who this man is?


00:25:15.655 --> 00:25:17.555
<i>That's the real John Ryder.</i>


00:25:17.690 --> 00:25:19.590
<i>He's been missing
since Tuesday.</i>


00:25:25.231 --> 00:25:26.391
Then who...


00:25:26.465 --> 00:25:27.591
<i>We don't know yet.</i>


00:25:28.200 --> 00:25:29.861
<i>Now, we've run his fingerprints and mug shots</i>


00:25:29.935 --> 00:25:30.993
<i>through every database
we've got,</i>


00:25:31.070 --> 00:25:32.128
<i>and we've come up
with nothing.</i>


00:25:32.204 --> 00:25:34.069
<i>This guy's a ghost.</i>


00:25:34.173 --> 00:25:37.142
<i>So, I need your help
here, Grace.</i>


00:25:37.243 --> 00:25:40.007
<i>Is there anything
he told you about himself?</i>


00:25:40.613 --> 00:25:41.739
<i>No.</i>


00:25:42.682 --> 00:25:43.774
<i>Anything at all?</i>


00:25:47.920 --> 00:25:48.944
No.


00:25:55.828 --> 00:25:57.386
Open cell F!


00:26:00.132 --> 00:26:04.626
Ryder, I need you to stand up and
put your hands behind your back.


00:26:04.704 --> 00:26:08.071
I need you to stand up, put
your hands behind your back.


00:26:28.694 --> 00:26:30.355
So, where are you from?


00:26:31.464 --> 00:26:32.726
All over.


00:26:34.934 --> 00:26:36.231
Is that so?


00:26:38.671 --> 00:26:40.866
<i>You're a sick fuck,
aren't ya?</i>


00:26:41.774 --> 00:26:44.265
The way you tortured
that young man.


00:26:44.710 --> 00:26:46.701
I know
you enjoyed yourself.


00:26:48.814 --> 00:26:50.475
<i>I just can't figure out
why you did it.</i>


00:26:50.616 --> 00:26:52.311
<i>You knew
you'd get caught.</i>


00:26:52.384 --> 00:26:53.976
<i>Why'd you do it?</i>


00:26:55.755 --> 00:26:56.983
Why not?


00:27:00.292 --> 00:27:02.692
How many others
have you killed?


00:27:07.366 --> 00:27:08.765
Hard to say.


00:27:13.005 --> 00:27:15.235
You see, here in the
great state of New Mexico,


00:27:15.374 --> 00:27:17.604
we do have
the death penalty.


00:27:20.079 --> 00:27:22.172
<i>You don't seem
too worried.</i>


00:27:25.284 --> 00:27:26.683
Should I be?


00:27:31.757 --> 00:27:34.157
You comfy down there, John?


00:27:34.593 --> 00:27:36.720
Are those cuffs
a little tight?


00:27:37.496 --> 00:27:39.123
Yeah, a little tight.


00:27:39.198 --> 00:27:41.928
Yeah, you see,
those are the new ones.


00:27:44.770 --> 00:27:48.137
They stretch out after you wear
them for a while. Let me see.


00:27:51.877 --> 00:27:53.401
Look at me.


00:27:57.149 --> 00:27:59.344
You have yourself
a nice trip.


00:28:00.553 --> 00:28:02.646
<i>We'll chat again real soon.</i>


00:28:03.722 --> 00:28:06.520
<i>Maybe next time,
you'll be better company.</i>


00:28:40.793 --> 00:28:41.782
Thanks.


00:28:45.231 --> 00:28:46.960
Where are we going?


00:28:47.366 --> 00:28:50.529
<i>I'm taking you to Albuquerque
for trauma support.</i>


00:28:50.736 --> 00:28:53.136
I can release you
to your parents there.


00:29:19.832 --> 00:29:21.197
Step up.


00:30:10.149 --> 00:30:12.310
<i>03 X-ray,
we're about 20 minutes out.</i>


00:30:12.384 --> 00:30:14.147
<i>Copy that, 03 X-ray.</i>


00:30:17.423 --> 00:30:18.617
I get home,
I look at my paycheck.


00:30:18.691 --> 00:30:19.680
<i>It's so skinny.</i>


00:30:20.459 --> 00:30:21.949
I decide to take
another job.


00:30:22.094 --> 00:30:23.618
<i>So now
I'm delivering pizza.</i>


00:30:31.537 --> 00:30:33.630
What are you getting your
daughter for her birthday?


00:30:33.739 --> 00:30:35.866
<i>She's just turned five.</i>


00:30:35.941 --> 00:30:37.465
She wants to take me...
Go to the mall,


00:30:37.543 --> 00:30:39.477
get one of those big
customized teddy bears.


00:30:39.545 --> 00:30:41.069
A customized teddy bear?
Come on.


00:30:41.146 --> 00:30:42.477
Yeah.


00:30:42.548 --> 00:30:45.346
<i>It's just another way
they can charge...</i>


00:31:06.805 --> 00:31:08.466
Look, Grace...


00:31:10.209 --> 00:31:11.335
I wish I could have
stopped this


00:31:11.410 --> 00:31:14.277
before it got
all out of control.


00:31:16.215 --> 00:31:20.049
<i>I know there's nothing that I
can say that'll bring Jim back,</i>


00:31:22.087 --> 00:31:23.645
but I am sorry.


00:31:24.823 --> 00:31:26.256
I truly am.


00:31:29.194 --> 00:31:31.526
Get your own little pants,
your own little jacket.


00:31:31.597 --> 00:31:33.622
Make your own
little teddy bear.


00:31:51.050 --> 00:31:52.881
For real, you spent
100 bucks on a teddy bear?


00:31:52.951 --> 00:31:54.441
Yeah, I know.
It was hurting me.


00:31:54.586 --> 00:31:56.076
<i>Yeah, it's 100 bucks...</i>


00:31:58.991 --> 00:32:01.425
<i>You know, this week's check, it's gone.</i>


00:32:22.047 --> 00:32:23.776
Stop moving.


00:32:23.849 --> 00:32:25.441
What the fuck?


00:32:33.559 --> 00:32:34.548
<i>It's cool...</i>


00:32:37.463 --> 00:32:38.555
Oh, shit!


00:32:43.802 --> 00:32:45.429
Son of a bitch!


00:33:04.490 --> 00:33:06.117
<i>My leg's stuck.</i>


00:33:11.964 --> 00:33:13.488
03 X-ray.


00:33:13.565 --> 00:33:16.056
I need a Code 3 backup
on Highway 19.


00:33:16.335 --> 00:33:17.859
<i>10-4, 03 X-ray.</i>


00:33:18.203 --> 00:33:22.333
Grace, I want you to run up over
that hill and wait there for help.


00:33:23.542 --> 00:33:25.442
<i>I'm done running.</i>


00:33:25.511 --> 00:33:27.843
Grace! Grace!


00:33:28.947 --> 00:33:30.812
<i>That's not the answer.</i>


00:33:31.216 --> 00:33:32.911
<i>You don't know
what you're doing.</i>


00:33:32.985 --> 00:33:34.316
Yes, I do.


00:33:42.027 --> 00:33:43.187
Grace!


00:33:51.470 --> 00:33:53.233
Grace, be careful!


00:34:08.420 --> 00:34:09.944
<i>Backup, now!
Let's go!</i>


00:34:15.694 --> 00:34:18.754
03 X-ray. Where the hell
is my goddamn backup?


00:34:23.402 --> 00:34:25.165
You better hurry.


00:35:22.127 --> 00:35:23.424
Grace!


00:35:46.818 --> 00:35:48.445
Go fuck yourself!


00:35:52.524 --> 00:35:53.548
No!


00:37:00.859 --> 00:37:02.884
<i>Feels good, doesn't it?</i>


00:37:04.363 --> 00:37:06.228
<i>I don't feel a thing.</i>

